{"route":"/docs/4.0/components/breadcrumb/","version":"4.0","renderedVersion":"4.0","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Breadcrumb","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Indicate the current page’s location within a navigational hierarchy that automatically adds separators via CSS."},"blocks":[{"id":"overview","type":"heading","en":"Overview","level":2},{"id":"overview--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Separators are automatically added in CSS through <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/::before\"><code>::before</code></a> and <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/content\"><code>content</code></a>."},{"id":"overview--example-1","type":"demo","key":"e18f7936011729897ebd","height":201},{"id":"overview--code-1","type":"code","value":"<nav aria-label=\"breadcrumb\">\n  <ol class=\"breadcrumb\">\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-item active\" aria-current=\"page\">Home</li>\n  </ol>\n</nav>\n\n<nav aria-label=\"breadcrumb\">\n  <ol class=\"breadcrumb\">\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-item\"><a href=\"#\">Home</a></li>\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-item active\" aria-current=\"page\">Library</li>\n  </ol>\n</nav>\n\n<nav aria-label=\"breadcrumb\">\n  <ol class=\"breadcrumb\">\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-item\"><a href=\"#\">Home</a></li>\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-item\"><a href=\"#\">Library</a></li>\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-item active\" aria-current=\"page\">Data</li>\n  </ol>\n</nav>","language":"html"},{"id":"accessibility","type":"heading","en":"Accessibility","level":2},{"id":"accessibility--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Since breadcrumbs provide a navigation, it’s a good idea to add a meaningful label such as <code>aria-label=&quot;breadcrumb&quot;</code> to describe the type of navigation provided in the <code>&lt;nav&gt;</code> element, as well as applying an <code>aria-current=&quot;page&quot;</code> to the last item of the set to indicate that it represents the current page."},{"id":"accessibility--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"For more information, see the <a href=\"https://www.w3.org/TR/wai-aria-practices/#breadcrumb\">WAI-ARIA Authoring Practices for the breadcrumb pattern</a>."}],"demos":[{"key":"e18f7936011729897ebd","html":"\n<nav aria-label=\"breadcrumb\">\n  <ol class=\"breadcrumb\">\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-item active\" aria-current=\"page\">Home</li>\n  </ol>\n</nav>\n\n<nav aria-label=\"breadcrumb\">\n  <ol class=\"breadcrumb\">\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-item\"><a href=\"#\">Home</a></li>\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-item active\" aria-current=\"page\">Library</li>\n  </ol>\n</nav>\n\n<nav aria-label=\"breadcrumb\">\n  <ol class=\"breadcrumb\">\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-item\"><a href=\"#\">Home</a></li>\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-item\"><a href=\"#\">Library</a></li>\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-item active\" aria-current=\"page\">Data</li>\n  </ol>\n</nav>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""}],"nav":[{"en":"Getting started","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.0/getting-started/introduction/"},{"en":"Introduction","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.0/getting-started/introduction/"},{"en":"Download","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.0/getting-started/download/"},{"en":"Contents","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.0/getting-started/contents/"},{"en":"Browsers & devices","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.0/getting-started/browsers-devices/"},{"en":"JavaScript","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.0/getting-started/javascript/"},{"en":"Theming","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.0/getting-started/theming/"},{"en":"Build tools","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.0/getting-started/build-tools/"},{"en":"Webpack","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.0/getting-started/webpack/"},{"en":"Accessibility","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.0/getting-started/accessibility/"},{"en":"Layout","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.0/layout/overview/"},{"en":"Ov